Modifications (dsh-workflow-monitor):
  - the scene is embedded in a DeepSeek Harness panel instead of a standalone page;
  - background music, fullscreen toggling and the local-storage preset store are
    removed from the shipped scene;
  - the simulated instrument data is replaced by a live telemetry snapshot pushed
    by the host plugin.

